WEBVTT

00:02:25.762 --> 00:02:31.766
how it can be tapped and made available
where and when needed to all and sundry.

00:02:33.144 --> 00:02:35.803
How does a continent that is home

00:02:35.827 --> 00:02:38.891
to some of the largest
bodies of water in the world --

00:02:39.708 --> 00:02:41.026
the Nile,

00:02:41.587 --> 00:02:42.828
the Niger,

00:02:43.291 --> 00:02:44.676
the Congo,

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:46.250
the Zambezi

00:02:46.274 --> 00:02:47.898
and the Orange Rivers --

00:02:48.553 --> 00:02:50.996
be said to have a water crisis,

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:53.067
including in countries

00:02:53.091 --> 00:02:54.733
where those rivers are?

00:02:56.387 --> 00:02:58.308
And that is only surface water.

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:03.006
While we wrongly dissipate our energies
fighting the wrong crises,